<title>POLAND: Poland's bourse approves listing for BOS bank.</title>
<headline>Poland's bourse approves listing for BOS bank.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The supervisory board of the Warsaw Stock Exchange approved for trading on its main floor Bank Ochrony Srodowiska SA (BOS) and cleared Poligrafia SA printing house for listing on the parallel market, it said.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement its board also cleared for listing a new issue of Pekpol on the main market and of Amerbank on the parallel market.</p>
<p>BOS issued 1.2 million new shares in a November 1996 public offering at 29 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>Poligrafia sold 1.36 million shares at 7.50 zlotys in the same month.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
